  "type": "anime",
  "title": "转学后班上的清纯可爱美少女，竟是小时候玩在一起的哥儿们",
  "original_title": "zhuanxuehoubanshangdeqingchunkeaimeishaonvjingshixiaoshihouwanzaiyiqidegeermen",
